:17:51.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-09T22:22:30.000Z","latest":"Grok Bot 每周限额已重置","digest":"xAI 正在连夜修复 Grok Bot 的 token 效率与行为问题，并已为所有用户重置每周使用限额。Elon Musk 称，他刚与 Grok @Bot 工程团队复盘，修复正在连夜实施，用户“明天应该会看到显著改善”；若未见改善，可回复其帖子，团队会立即处理剩余问题。Grok Bot 相关账号 @mattyp 此前也称改进正在进行，并请用户在该帖下回复反馈。\n\n11 月 10 日，Grok Bot 官方账号 @bot 称已为所有 Grok Bot 用户重置每周使用限额，@mattyp、xAI 的 Eric Zakariasson 及 Grok Bot 工程负责人 Lauren Tan 也确认了重置。\n\n修复的具体内容、适用范围和完成时间尚未披露，也没有效率提升幅度的数据；“显著改善”是 Musk 的预期，尚未得到验证。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-09T22:51:57.533Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/story/0d0f5f1f-b3ea-4b0f-bd3c-f6735cd0b4dc"},"reports":[{"id":"sc7m6l0mwvkwsd28wcyh1azu9","title":"Grok Bot 每周限额已重置","summary":"是时候动手做点东西了！！\n\n（引用推文：我们已为所有 Grok Bot 用户重置每周限额。尽情使用吧！）","source":{"name":"X：Lingxi Li（SpaceXSI，Grok Bot 工程） (@lingxi)","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T22:22:30.000Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/items/sc7m6l0mwvkwsd28wcyh1azu9","original":"https://x.com/lingxi/status/2119918581530194172"}},{"id":"ic8v7uh3japwjya5y2wkh0jiv","title":"Grok Bot 每周限额已重置","summary":"重置正在推送！","source":{"name":"X：Lauren Tan（SpaceXSI，Grok Bot 工程负责人） (@poteto)","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T19:32:28.000Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/items/ic8v7uh3japwjya5y2wkh0jiv","original":"https://x.com/poteto/status/2119875790485741964"}},{"id":"xn46b50fezcexcfjrbsndv8t7","title":"Grok Bot 每周限额已重置","summary":"重置 @bot 的每周限额","source":{"name":"X：Eric Zakariasson (@ericzakariasson)","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T19:30:03.000Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/items/xn46b50fezcexcfjrbsndv8t7","original":"https://x.com/ericzakariasson/status/2119875182940799080"}},{"id":"wz7uqw2s9qlm4a6cq0d8h9n7j","title":"Grok Bot 周限额已重置","summary":"Grok Bot 的每周限额已重置\n\n感谢大家的支持——团队正在昼夜不停地工作","source":{"name":"X：Matt Palmer（SpaceXSI，Grok Bot） (@mattyp)","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T19:27:38.000Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/items/wz7uqw2s9qlm4a6cq0d8h9n7j","original":"https://x.com/mattyp/status/2119874575580492207"}},{"id":"d56toetc3hcdjd4hwas283saz","title":"Grok Bot 重置所有用户周限额","summary":"我们已为所有 Grok Bot 用户重置每周限额。\n\n尽情享用！","source":{"name":"X：Grok Bot (@bot)","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T19:17:20.000Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/items/d56toetc3hcdjd4hwas283saz","original":"https://x.com/bot/status/2119871982946971659"}},{"id":"on03qbwvmdyls4kpua3dnftte","title":"马斯克称Grok Bot明日将大幅改进","summary":"Grok @Bot 明天将迎来“大幅改进”","source":{"name":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T02:33:58.000Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/items/on03qbwvmdyls4kpua3dnftte","original":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2119619475725287899"}},{"id":"q9k7bderhyy5bj6s2x5tsint3","title":"Grok Bot 工程团队连夜修复问题","summary":"刚和 Grok @Bot 工程团队做了一轮圆桌复盘。\n\n修复正在连夜实施，明天你应该会看到显著改善。如果没有，请回复这条帖子，我们会立即处理剩余问题。","source":{"name":"X：Elon Musk (@elonmusk, xAI)","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T02:25:56.000Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/items/q9k7bderhyy5bj6s2x5tsint3","original":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2119617455102333206"}},{"id":"bw4baps8s31nkvszvq8qmltzb","title":"Grok Bot 改进 token 效率与行为","summary":"Grok Bot 在 token 效率与行为方面的改进正在进行中\n\n你们许多人在 @bot 上构建了重要的工作流——我们希望继续支持你们\n\n请在这条帖子下回复反馈。我会全部阅读\n\n衷心感谢你们的支持","source":{"name":"X：Matt Palmer（SpaceXSI，Grok Bot） (@mattyp)","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-08T16:58:17.000Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/items/bw4baps8s31nkvszvq8qmltzb","original":"https://x.com/mattyp/status/2119474599708827957"}},{"id":"svii78aucgrcj4ccd1gzmtsq0","title":"xAI 正在改进 Grok Bot 的 token 效率","summary":"旨在提升 token 效率和更智能行为的 Grok Bot 修复正在进行中","source":{"name":"X：Elon Musk (@elonmusk, xAI)","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-08T13:17:51.000Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/items/svii78aucgrcj4ccd1gzmtsq0","original":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2119419126045454531"}}],"storyline":[],"related":[]},"storyStatus":"ok"}}]}
